Control of MDL601 (F3, F13): without a [client] section, mydumper hands the
file to the MySQL client library with the group "mydumper", so host, user and
password of [mydumper] are read by the client library and the connection
works.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL405
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
-- defaults.cnf --
[mydumper]
host=mysql
user=e2e
password=e2e-password
